		"description": "<p>1 Action, Reach: 8. Remove Soul Touched from the target and choose 1 of the following effects. If Soul Touched wasn’t removed, this does nothing:</p><ul><li><strong>Defile.</strong> Your next spell against your target has advantage 2 or they have disadvantage 2 on their save.</li><li><strong>Shelter.</strong> Your next harmful spell or Ruin ignores the target.</li></ul><hr><p><em>[A] Grants two separate Rite features — Rage Rite: Defile and Rage Rite: Shelter. Each checks and removes your Soul Touched on the target.</em></p><p><em>[M] Characters created before this update: delete and re-add Rage Rites to receive them.</em></p>",
